# 2. Voice Pipeline — Detailed Sequence

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 🎤 Caller / Browser
    participant WS as WebSocket<br/>/ws/voice
    participant VAD as Silero VAD
    participant STT as Faster-Whisper<br/>(CUDA INT8)
    participant RAG as ChromaDB<br/>Vector Search
    participant LLM as Qwen 2.5 6B<br/>(Ollama)
    participant TTS as Kokoro-82M<br/>(ONNX CUDA)
    participant OUT as WebSocket<br/>Output

    User->>WS: Binary PCM Audio Frames (16kHz, mono, 16-bit)
    WS->>VAD: Stream audio frames

    loop Until speech pause detected (>0.5s silence)
        VAD->>VAD: Buffer frames, detect voice activity
    end

    VAD->>STT: Speech segment audio bytes
    Note over STT: ~200ms inference<br/>0.8 GB VRAM
    STT->>RAG: Transcribed text query

    RAG->>RAG: Convert query → embedding vector
    RAG->>RAG: Cosine similarity search (k=3)
    RAG->>LLM: Query + Top-3 context chunks + system prompt

    Note over LLM: num_ctx: 2048<br/>~4.0 GB VRAM
    LLM->>TTS: Streaming text response chunks

    Note over TTS: Sub-200ms generation<br/>~0.35 GB VRAM
    TTS->>OUT: PCM audio frames (16kHz)
    OUT->>User: Binary audio response
```

